---
import DocsLayout from "../layouts/DocsLayout.astro";
import TierCards from "../components/TierCards.astro";

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<DocsLayout title="Overview">
  <h1>Leo Design System</h1>
  <p class="nvg-lead">
    Leo is the system. Navigato and Nox &amp; Vale are the brands — private stays and gallery
    objects on the same primitives, tokens, and booking composites. Switch brand and mode in
    the sidebar. There is no Leo theme.
  </p>

  <div class="not-prose my-8 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
    <div class="border border-border bg-card p-5">
      <p class="nvg-uppercase text-muted-foreground m-0 mb-3">Obsidian</p>
      <p class="nvg-wordmark m-0 text-lg">Navigato</p>
      <p class="m-0 mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground">
        Light: ink on mist. Dark: champagne on obsidian. Cinzel + Helvetica Neue stack. Globe mark.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-4 flex gap-2" aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="size-8 border border-border" style="background:#F4F2EE"></span>
        <span class="size-8 border border-border" style="background:#1C1917"></span>
        <span class="size-8 border border-border" style="background:#C4B59A"></span>
        <span class="size-8 border border-border" style="background:#0C0A09"></span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="border border-border bg-card p-5">
      <p class="nvg-uppercase text-muted-foreground m-0 mb-3">Gallery</p>
      <p class="nvg-wordmark m-0 text-lg">Nox &amp; Vale</p>
      <p class="m-0 mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground">
        Light: night on plaster. Dark: plaster on night. Jost. Disc + Brush N. Cobalt only as accent.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-4 flex gap-2" aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="size-8 border border-border" style="background:#F4F2EF"></span>
        <span class="size-8 border border-border" style="background:#111318"></span>
        <span class="size-8 border border-border" style="background:#1E4FD6"></span>
        <span class="size-8 border border-border" style="background:#9A9AA3"></span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="mt-10 space-y-4">
    <h2>What is Leo?</h2>
    <p>
      Leo is the official design system for Navigato and Nox &amp; Vale. The runtime package is
      still <code>@navigato/react</code> (workspace <code>0.2.0</code>, not on the public npm
      registry yet). Identity is tokens and marks, not a fork of Button. Do not add
      <code>data-brand="leo"</code>.
    </p>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1">
      <li>Two brands, each with light and dark, on Tailwind v4 CSS variables (<code>data-brand</code> + <code>.dark</code>)</li>
      <li>shadcn/ui primitives + booking composites — sharp corners, hairline borders</li>
      <li>Date range pickers, guest selectors, listing cards, booking widgets, price breakdowns</li>
      <li>A Nox &amp; Vale product page — not a fake hotel SERP</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="mt-10">
    <h2>Component tiers</h2>
    <p>Browse the library by Atomic Design tier — atoms, molecules, organisms, and demoable pages.</p>
    <TierCards base={base} tierLabel="Atoms" />
    <div class="mt-6">
      <a href={`${base}components/`} class="text-primary font-semibold no-underline hover:underline">
        View all components →
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mt-10 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 not-prose">
    <a
      href={`${base}tokens/colors/`}
      class="block border border-border bg-card p-5 no-underline transition-all duration-200 hover:border-primary/30"
    >
      <h3 class="m-0 text-base font-semibold text-primary">Colors</h3>
      <p class="m-0 mt-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Obsidian and Gallery palettes on semantic roles</p>
    </a>
    <a
      href={`${base}getting-started/`}
      class="block border border-border bg-card p-5 no-underline transition-all duration-200 hover:border-primary/30"
    >
      <h3 class="m-0 text-base font-semibold text-primary">Getting started</h3>
      <p class="m-0 mt-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Consume from the repo, set data-brand, first component</p>
    </a>
    <a
      href={`${base}components/pages/serp/`}
      class="block border border-border bg-card p-5 no-underline transition-all duration-200 hover:border-primary/30"
    >
      <h3 class="m-0 text-base font-semibold text-primary">SERP</h3>
      <p class="m-0 mt-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Navigato private stays — live filters, sold-out stays</p>
    </a>
    <a
      href={`${base}components/pages/gallery/`}
      class="block border border-border bg-card p-5 no-underline transition-all duration-200 hover:border-primary/30"
    >
      <h3 class="m-0 text-base font-semibold text-primary">Gallery</h3>
      <p class="m-0 mt-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Nox &amp; Vale product page — hoop, belt, add to bag</p>
    </a>
  </section>

  <section class="mt-10">
    <h2>Quick start</h2>
    <p>
      The package is <strong>not on npm yet</strong>. Consume from this repo (workspace or copy-in).
      Booking parts are <code>preview</code>, not <code>stable</code>.
    </p>
    <pre><code>{`import '@navigato/react/styles.css'
import { BookingSearchBar, ListingCard, GlobeMark } from '@navigato/react'`}</code></pre>
    <p class="mt-4">
      <a href={`${base}getting-started/`} class="text-primary font-semibold no-underline hover:underline">
        Read the getting started guide →
      </a>
    </p>
  </section>
</DocsLayout>
